<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Best in Slot Gear list for Fury Warrior DPS in Cataclysm Classic Pre-Patch. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Heroic Dungeons, reputations and professions.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">
<span class="c4">Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear for Fury Warrior DPS in Pre-Patch</span></h2>
<ol>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Hit Rating - You will want a total of at least 8% chance to hit, equating to 961 hit rating. However, extra hit is always key, as with the changes to Heroic Strike our white hits are no longer guaranteed to hit any more.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Expertise Rating - Expertise reduces the chance to be dodged or parried - a crucial stat to avoid important abilities such as <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=86346/colossus-smash">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_colossussmash.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Colossus Smash</span></a> missing.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Strength - As our primary stat, we will seek to obtain Strength wherever possible, in slots such as gems and enchants</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Critical Strike - Our most desired Secondary stat.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Mastery - Our second most desired Secondary stat.</div></li></ol>
