<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="feet-for-fury-warrior-dps">Feet for Fury Warrior DPS</h4>While the best boots available are <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58195/woe-breeders-boots">
<img alt="Woe Breeder's Boots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Woe Breeder's Boots</span></a>, they are gated behind Valor, and might be too difficult to obtain before Raid. However, they are only ~160 DPS ahead of the next best option, and are also BoE, meaning you can purchase them with gold if you have deeper pockets.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Feet Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74199/enchant-boots-haste">
