<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings-for-fury-warrior-dps">Rings for Fury Warrior DPS</h4>While there are some expensive options for rings, as well as a valor option, these may not be available for all players. Luckily, there are plenty of other ring options.<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Ring Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74215/enchant-ring-strength">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Ring - Strength</span></a> -  Only Enchanters may apply Ring Enchants on their own rings.<div class="pad"></div>
<table class="grid max-width">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-background="c1" style="width: 10%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Rank</b></td>
<td data-background="c1" style="width: 25%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Item</b></td>
<td data-background="c1" style="width: 20%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Sockets</b></td>
<td data-background="c1" style="width: 23%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Source</b></td>
<td data-background="c1" style="width: 22%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Location</b></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>Best</td>
