<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Fury Warrior DPS</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="two-handed-weapons-for-fury-warrior-dps">Two Handed Weapons for Fury Warrior DPS</h4>The immensely powerful <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64377/zinrokh-destroyer-of-worlds">
<img alt="Zin'rokh, Destroyer of Worlds" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_zinrokh-sword.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Zin'rokh, Destroyer of Worlds</span></a> is our best pre raid weapon. However, it comes from a very rare drop in archeology, and can be very elusive. If you aren't lucky in your digging destiny, then there are a couple of other weapons available, all of which can be very suitable.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74246/enchant-weapon-landslide">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Landslide</span></a>
